{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/commandsReplaced(content:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"commandsReplaced","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI15CommandsBuilderV","text":"CommandsBuilder","kind":"attribute","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/CommandsBuilder"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI8CommandsP","text":"Commands","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Commands"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"content","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"Commands","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" builder whose output will be used to replace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the commands normally provided by the modified scene."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that replaces any commands defined by its children"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with alternative content."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"},{"type":"text","text":", and other scene types all have an associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set of commands that they include by default. Apply this modifier to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene to replace those commands with the output from the given builder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, the following code adds a scene for showing the contents of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the pasteboard in a dedicated window. We replace the scene’s default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Window > Clipboard menu command with a custom Edit > Show Clipboard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"command that we place next to the other pasteboard commands.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct Example: App {","    @Environment(\\.openWindow) var openWindow","","    var body: some Scene {","        ...","","        Window(\"Clipboard\", id: \"clipboard\") {","            ClipboardContentView()","        }","        .commandsReplaced {","            CommandGroup(after: .pasteboard) {","                Section {","                    Button(\"Show Clipboard\") {","                        openWindow(id: \"clipboard\")","                    }","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":null}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/commandsreplaced(content:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","